      <child nodeId="node-67"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-67">
    <command xml:space="preserve">[enter]</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The puzzle of the game is pretty straightforward and you are confined to a single room so I won't give you too much help.&#x000A;&#x000A;However, to ensure that you aren't failing because you don't know the appropriate words... Following are all of the actions that you might need in order to succeed in the game, other than the cardinal directions: examine, look, search, take, pull, drop, pry something with something, dig something with something, enter, leave, and wait.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Please press SPACE to continue.</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-68"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-68">
    <command xml:space="preserve"> </command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Introduction to A Day in the Dungeon&#x000A;   Instructions for Play&#x000A; &gt; Hint&#x000A;&#x000A;   Introduction to A Day in the Dungeon&#x000A;   Instructions for Play&#x000A; &gt; Hint</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-69"/>
    </children>
  </item>
